=== TRAVEL ESTIMATE REQUIRED ===
The player has named a destination. This is travel — out-of-combat overland movement.
Combat-round timings (6 seconds, 0.0017 hours) DO NOT APPLY here. Travel between named
locations takes at least tens of minutes and usually hours. Estimate both
`hours_elapsed` AND `distance_miles` based on terrain:
  Road / plains:    ~3 mph (24 miles per 8-hour day)
  Hills / forest:   ~2 mph (16 miles per day)
  Mountains / swamp: ~1.5 mph (12 miles per day)

Minimum travel estimate: 0.25 hours (a few minutes' walk inside a settlement).
Most journeys are >= 0.5 hours. Never return less than 0.25 unless the destination
is the same room or adjacent square the player is already in.

Include `direction` when discernible from context (north/south/east/west/etc).

<% else -%>
=== PATHFINDER 1e TIME REFERENCE (out-of-combat actions) ===
- Dialogue or brief conversation: 1–5 minutes (0.02–0.08 hours)
- Short search of a room: 10–30 minutes (0.17–0.5 hours)
- Hunting or foraging for food: 1–4 hours (Survival activity)
- Tracking a creature: 1–4 hours depending on trail and terrain
- Crafting a simple item: 1–4 hours
- Take 20 on a skill check: 20× the normal time (usually ~40 minutes)
- Resting (full night): 8 hours
- Short rest: 1–2 hours
- Waiting / standing guard: 1–4 hours, depending on context
- Studying or reading: 1–4 hours depending on material
- Preparing spells: 1 hour

